s://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_TOOL_Music_Lyre_FalataericCliLyre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_TOOL_Music_Lyre_FalataericCliLyre\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">3542b820-713a-4dd3-9cc8-35586f4e7f46</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3542b820-713a-4dd3-9cc8-35586f4e7f46\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3542b820-713a-4dd3-9cc8-35586f4e7f46\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Lyre)\" title=\"Perform (Lyre)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp/80px-Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform (Lyre)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Lyre)\" title=\"Perform (Lyre)\">Perform (Lyre)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Chromatic_Scale\" title=\"Chromatic Scale\">Chromatic Scale</a>: Can be purchased from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thomas_C._Quirkilious\" title=\"Thomas C. Quirkilious\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png/25px-Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png/38px-Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png/50px-Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thomas C. Quirkilious\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png/25px-Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thomas_C._Quirkilious\" title=\"Thomas C. Quirkilious\">Thomas C. Quirkilious</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In Forgotten Realms lore, the College of Cli was one of Falataer's seven Bard colleges, located in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City of Baldur's Gate</a>. The <a href=\"/wiki/Elfsong_Tavern\" title=\"Elfsong Tavern\">Elfsong Tavern</a> was once part of its campus.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202534\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2066/1000000\nPost‐e